title: A month without a single crisis
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.year == 2020 && Q.month == 2) {
    Q.news_headline = "The presidential campaign struggles for oxygen";
}
if (Q.year == 2020 && Q.month == 8) {
    Q.news_headline = "The alliance counts its losses before the merger";
}
if (Q.year == 2021 && Q.month == 2) {
    Q.news_headline = "Vaccination and the published Tribunal ruling reshape winter politics";
}
if (Q.year == 2021 && Q.month == 4) {
    Q.news_headline = "The recovery fund divides the governing coalition";
}
!}

= [+ date_label +]

[? if year = 2020 and month = 2: [+ presidential_candidate +]'s campaign tours a country already
watching the first reports of a new virus. KO fights over its own nomination;
Hołownia builds an outsider movement; the Left's message competes with both. ?]

[? if year = 2020 and month = 8: The presidential result has redistributed
prestige but settled nothing. SLD and Wiosna prepare their legal merger while
Razem asks whether unity still has a programme. ?]

[? if year = 2021 and month = 2: Vaccine access grows while the abortion
judgment enters force. Public health and the rights conflict now share the same
organising networks. ?]

[? if year = 2021 and month = 4: Solidarna Polska opposes the EU recovery
mechanism. PiS begins looking for opposition votes; every opposition party
calculates who will be blamed for the bargain. ?]

[? if not (year = 2020 and month = 2) and not (year = 2020 and month = 8) and not (year = 2021 and month = 2) and not (year = 2021 and month = 4):
No single shock dominates the month. ?]

- @poland_hub: Return to the leadership table
